# Calma Studio — AI Content Automation Case Study

A simulated business diagnostic and automation build, created as a portfolio 
project to demonstrate AI-powered content systems, prompt engineering, and 
workflow automation for social media operations.

---

## What is this?

**Calma Studio** is a fictional online wellness and mindfulness platform 
(Spain/Portugal/LATAM/UK · 8 people · €180K ARR). I created it to simulate 
a real consulting engagement:

1. **Diagnosed the problem** — mapped every manual content task and quantified the time cost
2. **Designed the system** — Claude prompts + Zapier workflows + Notion editorial calendar
3. **Built the automation** — working solution for multilingual content creation across Instagram, LinkedIn and Facebook

---

## The problem

Calma Studio's 2-person team was spending 12+ hours per week creating social 
media content manually across 4 languages (ES, PT, EN) and 3 platforms 
(Instagram, LinkedIn, Facebook). No consistent tone, no editorial calendar, 
LinkedIn completely abandoned.

---

## The diagnostic: time audit

| Task | Frequency | Time/week | Languages |
|------|-----------|-----------|-----------|
| Instagram caption writing | Daily | 3.5 hrs | ES, PT, EN |
| LinkedIn post writing | 2x/week | 2 hrs | EN, ES |
| Facebook community posts |ss